<title>SINGAPORE: Auric first half pre-tax profits rise.</title>
<headline>Auric first half pre-tax profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit				1.03 vs  0.87</p>
<p>    Turnover				 91.01 vs 87.84</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.17 vs  1.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)		3.55 vs  3.77</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			  2.73 vs  2.71</p>
<p>    Tax					 1.51 vs  1.64</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (loss) 0.19 vs  0.19 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Food company Auric Pacific said it expected no further losses from associated company, The Beverage Company of Asia Pte Ltd, and full year results would not change significantly from the half year position.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
